export anchor GlossyAquaStyle:
    number: 31
    screen: SignIn
    name: Glossy aqua
    idea: An early-2000s desktop window, brushed metal chrome on a pinstripe backdrop, with blue jelly buttons that look wet enough to press.
    base: light
    palette:
        pinstripe: #f7f7f7 and #ececec, the page in alternating 2px stripes
        brushedMetal: #e9ebee to #c9ccd1, the title bar and toolbar with fine vertical streaks
        window: #f4f5f7, the window body
        text: #1d1d1f, body text
        muted: #4f545c, sub lines and the status bar
        bevelLine: #a7acb4, group borders and section tabs
        jellyBlue: #2a6bc2, the primary gel button and the selected row
        jellyDeep: #0e4a9c, the lower half of the gel
        jellyGlow: #8cc0f4, the inner glow at the bottom of the gel
        focusRing: #6fa8eb, the focus halo
        link: #0b4fae, links
        error: #b3141b, error text and the error field border
        done: #23733a, On track text
    type:
        Lucida Grande, Lucida Sans Unicode, Lucida Sans, Helvetica Neue,
        Verdana, Tahoma, system-ui, sans-serif. The brand is 22px bold with
        a white emboss, the heading 17px bold, labels 13px bold and right
        aligned with a trailing colon, field text 14px, body 13px at 1.45,
        and the status bar 11px.
    layout:
        A single desktop window 640px wide floating on the pinstripe. A
        brushed metal title bar with one grey glossy orb at the left and
        the word Brightwork centred. A toolbar band with a glossy blue app
        orb holding a tick, the brand and a sub line. The body has the
        heading, two pill sign-in buttons side by side, an etched or
        divider, then a sunken group box with a two column form of right
        aligned labels and fields. The bottom of the group holds the create
        account line on the left and the jelly Sign in button on the right.
        A status bar closes the window with Privacy and Terms. At 375px the
        pills and labels stack and Sign in goes full width.
    spacing: Tight, a 4px base. 12px between form rows and 24 to 28px window padding.
    density: Compact desktop density, 13px type and 30px controls.
    corners: Fully round pill buttons, 10px top window corners, 6px group boxes and 4px fields.
    borders: 1px grey bevels, darker on top for sunken fields. Dividers are a grey line over a white line.
    shadows:
        A deep soft window shadow, inset field shadows, and gel buttons
        with a white reflection over the top half and a light blue inner
        glow at the bottom.
    icons:
        Glossy orbs and gel balls with a white reflection. Grey letter
        orbs G and M on sign-in buttons, a red octagon with a cross for the
        error, a tick inside the app orb, and a small triangle on the
        selected list row.
    focus: A 1px blue line and a 3px light blue halo around any control. A focused field gets a blue border and the same halo.
    tone: Plain desktop dialog words with a colon after each label, such as Email and Password followed by a colon.
